                                                "sense_id": "d2fb2eda-b15c-30aa-b6b2-2915b1ed8385",
                                                "text": "`Sprung!' cried Jeff Basin, the local dubbo. 'Oh, der,' moaned Boardie sarcastically."
                                            },
